WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.709
This is Contraction Watch, a contraction timer that runs on the Xiaomi Smart Band 10.

00:00:06.709 --> 00:00:13.106
It's a personal prototype, not a medical device, so always follow your midwife's advice.

00:00:14.606 --> 00:00:17.178
When a contraction begins, tap Start.

00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:18.776
When it ends, tap Stop.

00:00:18.776 --> 00:00:24.337
The band shows how long it lasted, and you can undo it if you tapped by mistake.

00:00:24.337 --> 00:00:28.717
The band can't feel contractions, so your taps are the record.

00:00:30.217 --> 00:00:32.330
Open the menu and choose Summary.

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:39.692
You'll see how many contractions you've had in the last hour, how far apart they are, and a chart of their lengths.

00:00:39.692 --> 00:00:42.573
Bars above the line lasted a minute or more.

00:00:44.073 --> 00:00:53.587
When a pattern needs a call, such as contractions about five minutes apart, lasting a minute, for an hour, the band vibrates and shows an alert.

00:00:53.587 --> 00:00:59.005
Warning symptoms, like bleeding or your waters breaking, alert you straight away.

00:01:00.505 --> 00:01:05.950
Under Call, save your maternity unit, your partner, and your local emergency number.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:12.755
The band can't place calls itself, so it shows the number in large digits for you to dial on your phone.

00:01:14.255 --> 00:01:18.917
In Settings, set your pregnancy week, because it changes which alerts apply.

00:01:18.917 --> 00:01:22.535
And the short tutorial is always there under How it works.

00:01:24.035 --> 00:01:30.817
To install from an iPhone: get AstroBox from the App Store, and save the app file in Files.

00:01:30.817 --> 00:01:37.450
Get your band's key with the QR sign-in at miband.trinh.uk, and keep it private.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:46.318
Close Mi Fitness, connect the band in AstroBox with the key, then choose Quick Apps, Install RPK, and pick the file.

00:01:47.818 --> 00:01:53.260
On Android, install AstroBox from its website, and download the app file.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:57.657
Get the band key the same way, or from the Mi Fitness logs.

00:01:57.657 --> 00:02:04.441
Force stop Mi Fitness, connect the band in AstroBox, and install the file under Quick Apps.

00:02:04.441 --> 00:02:07.572
Notify for Xiaomi, a paid app, works too.

00:02:09.072 --> 00:02:14.241
If something feels wrong, call your maternity unit, whatever the band shows.

00:02:14.241 --> 00:02:17.302
The full install guide is on shawaiz.de.

00:02:17.302 --> 00:02:19.071
Good luck, and take care.
